ModelForge public alpha third-party notices
===========================================

The base `modelforge_workbench` Python runtime contains no third-party Python
runtime library, model, dataset, weight, checkpoint, brand asset, or generated
media. Python is supplied by the user's installation. The packaged browser
bundle contains the pinned JavaScript runtime libraries listed below.
Setuptools and wheel are Python build tools; pytest, Ruff, build, and Twine are
development tools and are not included in the wheel.

Optional external Codex integration
-----------------------------------

ModelForge can connect to an OS-user-installed Codex CLI through Codex App
Server. Codex is not included in this repository, the Python package, or the
compiled React bundle. Installing or using Codex is governed by its own terms;
ModelForge does not redistribute its executable, SDK, credentials, or model.

